# {{alternative spelling of|[[knackwurst]]}}
German metaphor for a heavy-handed person, whose behavior stinks (like the stench of a highly seasoned sausage).  David Letterman added "knockwurst" to the anti-Leno glossary on "Live with Regis and Kelly", April 30, 2010.        Source: Larry's Dictionary of Life